{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55817","headline":"偈 一 · 慧忠","name":"偈 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪後始知松柏操，云收方见济淮（《五灯会元》作「河」）分。\n不因世主令（《五灯会元》作「教」）还俗，那辨鷄羣与鹤羣。\n多年尘土（《五灯会元》作「事」）谩腾腾，虽着伽黎（《五灯会元》作「方袍」）未是僧。\n今日归来酬本志，不妨留发候然灯。\n（《五灯会元》作「仪」）虽变道常存，混俗心源亦不昏。\n试读善财巡礼偈，当时岂例是（《五灯会元》作「作」）沙门。\n（见《禅林僧宝传》卷十、《五灯会元》卷十四。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧忠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}